@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = paste-token-here
@gardenId = 1
@bedId = 1
@planId = 1
@cropId = 1

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "developer@example.com", "username": "developer", "password": "example-password-123"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=developer&password=example-password-123

### Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crop catalogue (names in en and fi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/crops
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a garden
POST {{baseUrl}}/gardens
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Allotment"}

### Garden with its active beds (add ?include_archived=true for archived beds)
GET {{baseUrl}}/gardens/{{gardenId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a bed (metres)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gardens/{{gardenId}}/beds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "North bed", "x": 0, "y": 0, "width": 1.2, "height": 4}

### Record history; omit start_month/end_month to use the crop's default window
POST {{baseUrl}}/beds/{{bedId}}/plantings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"crop_id": {{cropId}}, "year": 2026, "start_month": "2026-04", "end_month": "2026-06"}

### Garden history
GET {{baseUrl}}/gardens/{{gardenId}}/plantings?year_from=2024
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create next year's plan (one per garden and year)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"garden_id": {{gardenId}}, "year": 2027}

### Request a crop (sets the quantity if already requested)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{planId}}/crops
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"crop_id": {{cropId}}, "quantity": 2}

### Place a crop manually (locked by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{planId}}/placements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bed_id": {{bedId}}, "crop_id": {{cropId}}}

### Plan with requested/placed counts and placements
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{planId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Complete the plan and write its placements to history
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{planId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Database readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
